WEBVTT

00:26:59.128 --> 00:27:02.017
I'm like, "Turn your head this way.
Turn your head that way,"

00:27:02.041 --> 00:27:04.403
and you're trying to get
the hand positions right.

00:27:04.427 --> 00:27:06.418
Coco: OK, cutting. (Scissors snip)

00:27:06.442 --> 00:27:08.844
JA: OK. Now I'll ask you
to go in and point-cut it.

00:27:08.868 --> 00:27:11.114
Coco: Got it. OK, so now
I'm point-cutting this.

00:27:11.138 --> 00:27:14.486
So basically ... Ohhhh.

00:27:14.510 --> 00:27:17.556
JA: People being so willing
and trusting --

00:27:17.580 --> 00:27:19.700
that was one thing that
shocked me the most.

00:27:19.724 --> 00:27:21.944
Coco: A little bit higher? OK.
JA: Right there.

00:27:21.968 --> 00:27:23.370
Coco: So, like, here?
JA: Yep.

00:27:23.394 --> 00:27:25.027
Coco: OK. Cutting. (Scissors snip)

00:27:25.051 --> 00:27:26.705
JA: OK, now I want you to ...

00:27:26.729 --> 00:27:29.526
AG: So far, there haven't been
any major hair disasters,

00:27:29.550 --> 00:27:31.176
and by moving his job online,